---
import SubpageLayout from '../../../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Do I need a visa to visit Nauru?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'All foreign nationals must obtain a visa before arriving in Nauru. There is no visa on arrival. Confirm entry rules before travel and apply early as processing can take weeks.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What should I prepare for my visa application?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Check passport validity, confirm current entry requirements for your nationality, apply with enough lead time, and keep copies of all supporting documents including travel and accommodation proof.',
      },
    },
  ],
};
---

<SubpageLayout title="Viza" description="Entry rules, document prep and lead time." sectionEmoji="🛂" sectionLabel="Taramit Ñago" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true} locale="na">
  <p>Viza ekea: always confirm entry rules before travel. Processing can take weeks, so the safest plan is to check early and keep copies of all supporting papers.</p>
<div class="callout-grid">
  <div class="callout"><h3>Prepare documents</h3><p>Passport, forms and any confirmation letters.</p></div>
  <div class="callout"><h3>Expect lead time</h3><p>Do not leave visa work to the last minute.</p></div>
  <div class="callout"><h3>Verify rules</h3><p>Requirements can change — re-check before departure.</p></div>
  <div class="callout"><h3>Keep copies</h3><p>Use both digital and printed backups.</p></div>
</div>
<h2>Checklist</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Check passport validity.</li>
  <li>Confirm the current entry requirement for your nationality.</li>
  <li>Apply with enough lead time.</li>
  <li>Keep onward travel and accommodation proof ready.</li>
</ul>
<div class="info-box"><h4>Contact</h4><p>Use the directory or Government Information Office to verify the latest requirements before you travel.</p></div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{display:grid;gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .utility-card,.callout,.contact-card,.link-grid a{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:18px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;display:block}
  .utility-card h3,.callout h3,.contact-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#002B7F}
  
  @media (max-width: 720px){.utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
